4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"p=E"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fb7ae7ef-57f0-43c7-82c5-221db528eef3","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"あーなんだっけこれ…補完が\"\\n\"じゃなくて\"\\r\"になるやつ…","ts":"1618848291.114600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DKmJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e747b557-78df-4fae-9571-c0c31a2638b0","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"改行が化けよった","ts":"1618847796.113900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"T=t"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2cfa544f-dd89-4424-9ec6-cdfb7f4b1d24","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"わ","ts":"1618847790.113600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"d8F6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"69d23ad8-1953-4062-a21a-aab2ea3c2090","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"```for i, j := 0, len(x)-1; i \u0026lt; j; i, j = i+1, j-1 {\n  x[i], x[j] = x[j], x[i]\n}```\nx.reverse! で ↑ になりますｗ","ts":"1618847746.113300","edited":{"user":"U8R597E9H","ts":"1618847758.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FAN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7f364dc4-3346-4d9e-90f0-f23c87232597","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"x.for! とかまでは「便利便利」と思えましたが、x.reverse! はちょっと出力が面白かった。","ts":"1618847721.112800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rVB08"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0a0236d8-3122-4ad1-9220-322a37675ee7","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"goplsフルで生きてると、テストとかも書きやすいからすごく便利","ts":"1618847700.112100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"d8UU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5c9f9fd8-62e1-45d1-9b13-3fde1cd47636","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"vscodeだと確かに乗ってるlspいたなソレ","ts":"1618847665.111000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Cvz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eca70e89-e7fd-4714-9fd9-ccdf28ce93cd","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"なんか懐かしい機能ですねソレ。atomとか思い出した","ts":"1618847653.110700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0o0yl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"387deaed-35e2-4970-af87-82239ee485a3","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"あー","ts":"1618847638.110200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"z3e"}]},{"client_msg_id":"56dd76e0-e525-4a4b-898b-1d2702a19e2f","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"```x := []int{ 1, 2, 3 }\nx.|```\nで `append!` という候補がでてくるのですが、これを選ぶと `x = append(x, |)` この状態になります。","ts":"1618847622.109900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["UFYACJ537"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9rTA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"82a8aed7-ff77-40a6-96b5-f69d5f6e66ae","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"最新の gopls の設定でおすすめはこれです。（僕も最近知りましたが、experimentalPostfixCompletions が便利）\n```  require'lspconfig'.gopls.setup {\n    capabilities = capabilities,\n    on_init = on_init;\n    init_options = {\n      gofumpt = true,\n      usePlaceholders = true,\n      semanticTokens = true,\n      staticcheck = true,\n      experimentalPostfixCompletions = true,\n      hoverKind = 'Structured',\n      analyses = {\n        nilness = true,\n        shadow = true,\n        unusedparams = true,\n        unusedwrite = true,\n        fieldalignment = true\n      },\n      codelenses = {\n        gc_details = true,\n        tidy = true\n      }\n    }\n  }```","ts":"1618847544.109000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"god","count":4,"users":["UGXMRNBUM","UFYACJ537","UBDMG6N2J","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BkQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8e949bac-fb03-4fb1-b27d-57952f41ccfa","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"lspがどんなオプションで動いてるかさっと見たいな…えらい時間を費やしてしまった","ts":"1618847521.108600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"B4vp0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2ecca24e-ef01-4cbc-b53a-27292f8e8e51","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"nvim-lspconfig×goplsだと、init_optionsのusePlaceholdersがtrueにならないのか","ts":"1618847499.108000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ky/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"80bd65de-c9d5-4027-b16f-75b7aeebbd4b","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"ついに見つけた","ts":"1618847452.107400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kZz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4522a79e-18dd-4c96-9c1d-50a2143c3044","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"（しかもまだ書いてないところがある…）","ts":"1618845489.106700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MjSO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"da88193e-d13d-4a3c-b451-47954235c7ec","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"何かから生成したいタイプの面倒臭さ","ts":"1618845481.106500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BnFLd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f1c70663-c1e8-40a3-9662-324822eccab1","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"めんどいのはわかる","ts":"1618845471.106100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cPL0f"}]},{"client_msg_id":"49a0c3c5-8927-445a-b895-894b5f6a5def","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"doc 書くの正直めんどかったですね。 Markdown で良いならそっちのほうが慣れてるので楽","ts":"1618845457.105900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MFEJE"}]},{"client